Many Rivers to Cross
Technology has created opportunities and transformed local economies. But that transformation will only continue if every person at every stage of their life, and from every social stratum, has access to information and communications technologies. Through guidance and training from CTCs around the world, grants in the form of funds, or software, curriculum, and hardware, Microsoft Unlimited Potential will continue to focus on the shift from a digitally divided world to one of digital inclusion. We believe in public and private partnerships because this goal is bigger than any one company. It is also a goal that represents the purest expression of the Microsoft mission: to enable people to realize their full potential.
Footnotes
1
Norman Saunders, “employment Outlook 2004-2014: A Summary of BLS Projections” Monthly Labor Review Online, Nov. 2005.
2
