BMY,Bristol-Myers Squibb,Healthcare,2017,"Mission, Vision & Values of Bristol-Myers Squibb Company
To our patients and customers, employees, global communities, shareholders, environment and other stakeholders, we promise to act on our belief that the priceless ingredient of every product is the integrity of its maker. We operate with effective governance and high standards of ethical behavior. We seek transparency and dialogue with our stakeholders to improve our understanding of their needs. We take our commitment to economic, social and environmental sustainability seriously, and extend this expectation to our partners and suppliers.
We commit to scientific excellence and investment in biopharmaceutical research and development to provide innovative, high-quality medicines that address the unmet medical needs of patients with serious diseases. We apply scientific rigor to produce clinical and economic benefit through medicines that improve patients’ lives. We strive to make information about our commercialized medicines widely and readily available.
We embrace a diverse workforce and inclusive culture. The health, safety, professional development, work-life balance and equitable, respectful treatment of our employees are among our highest priorities.
We promote conscientious citizenship that improves health and promotes sustainability in our communities.
We strive to produce sustained strong performance and shareholder value.
We encourage the preservation of natural resources and strive to minimize the environmental impact of our operations and products.",False,integrity_ethics_trust|patient_health_outcomes|diversity_equity_inclusion|environmental_sustainability,"A values-heavy mission page built on the line that 'the priceless ingredient of every product is the integrity of its maker', with commitments on governance, transparency and sustainability. The commitments are qualitative (diverse workforce, preserve natural resources) with no metrics or targets.","First available year, so there is no prior to compare against.",,,environmental_sustainability|integrity_ethics_trust|innovation_technology|people_culture,OK,https://www.bms.com/about-us/our-company/our-mission.html,20170508191303,1541,
