Expanding Opportunity and Human Achievement
We are taking action to achieve diversity, equity and inclusion (DEI) within our workforce and in the broader community, with the goal of improving lives and making the world a more equitable place.
Our DEI Commitment
Performance Production
Performance Production
For more than a century, our high-performing teams have driven advancements in the production of energy. Today we’re applying our culture of innovation to help solve our planet’s most pressing environmental challenges. We have built safe, efficient operations that harness the power of large-scale CO2 storage technology to drive our enhanced oil recovery (EOR) programs. At the same time, we're taking concrete steps on the ground to reduce our emissions.
Essential Chemistry
Essential Chemistry
OxyChem plays a critical role in creating products that improve lives, advance society and uplift the global community. We develop and manufacture chemical products used to purify water, build communities and vehicles, create climate-friendly refrigerants and produce life-saving pharmaceuticals and medical supplies. We focus on safe and sustainable manufacturing operations as we pursue a lower-carbon future.
Carbon Innovation
Carbon Innovation
As we take bold steps to reduce emissions across every facet of our business, we’re creating the future. Utilizing our robust CO2 management infrastructure, we are accelerating carbon capture, utilization and storage (CCUS), direct air capture and other visionary technologies to decarbonize our operations and help other industries do the same.
