Our Net-Zero Pathway
Oxy has set goals to achieve net-zero emissions in our operations and energy use before 2040, and net-zero emissions from the use of products by our customers with an ambition to do so before 2050. We’re systematically combining Oxy’s infrastructure, experience and resources with carbon capture and removal technologies to help us achieve net zero.
